============
 state.conf
============

----------------------------------
gxdm display manager configuration
----------------------------------

:Date: August 2014
:Version: gxdm @SDDM_VERSION_STRING@
:Manual section: 5
:Manual group: gxdm

SYNOPSIS
========

~gxdm/state.conf

DESCRIPTION
===========

This file carries state configuration for the gxdm display manager **gxdm**\(1\).

OPTIONS
=======

The following options are configured in the [Last] section:

`Session=`
	Name of the session file of the last session selected.
	This session will be preselected when the login screen shows up.
	Default value is empty.

`User=`
	Name of last logged-in user. This username will be
	preselected/shown when the login screen shows up.
	Default value is empty.

The following options are configured in the [Greeter] section:

`CursorTheme=`
	Global cursor theme used by the greeter. An empty value keeps the
	configured display-manager default.

`Wallpaper=`
	Global wallpaper used by the greeter. The value can be an absolute path
	or a Qt resource path bundled with the greeter.

SEE ALSO
========

**gxdm**\(1\)

The full documentation for gxdm is available at https://github.com/sddm/sddm
